{"title": "Stench", "pageid": 27153, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Stench", "categories": ["Class actions", "Bonus actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Stinking_Cloud.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Stinking_Cloud.webp/300px-Stinking_Cloud.webp, /w/images/4/46/Stinking_Cloud.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Stinking_Cloud.webp/300px-Stinking_Cloud.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/46/Stinking_Cloud.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Stench</b> is an action unique to <a href=\"/wiki/Ghast\" title=\"Ghast\">Ghasts</a>. It creates lingering clouds of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nauseous_(Condition)\" title=\"Nauseous (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nauseating\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nauseous_(Condition)\" title=\"Nauseous (Condition)\">Nauseating</a> fumes wherever the ghast moves.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Emit the stench of tomb mould and abattoirs to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ghastly_Fume_(Condition)\" title=\"Ghastly Fume (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nauseate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ghastly_Fume_(Condition)\" title=\"Ghastly Fume (Condition)\">Nauseate</a> nearby foes. \n</p>\nNausea can be cleared if targets become <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wet\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\">Wet</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 2 m (7 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 2 m (7 ft) Radius</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Creates Area: Stinking Cloud\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Creates Area: Stinking Cloud</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per combat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per combat</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Stench_Ghast</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Stench_Ghast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Stench_Ghast\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/IsEnemySpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsEnemySpell (spell flag)\">IsEnemySpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Ghastly_Fume\"> Condition: Ghastly Fume </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ghastly_Fume_(Condition)\" title=\"Ghastly Fume (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ghastly Fume\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ghastly_Fume_(Condition)\" title=\"Ghastly Fume (Condition)\">Ghastly Fume</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<p>The affected entity's foul stench creates a pungent cloud that <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nauseous_(Condition)\" title=\"Nauseous (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nauseates\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nauseous_(Condition)\" title=\"Nauseous (Condition)\">Nauseates</a> all creatures around it.\n</p>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Area:_Stinking_Cloud\"> Area: Stinking Cloud </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stinking_Cloud_(cloud)\" title=\"Stinking Cloud (cloud)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Stinking_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp/30px-Stinking_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Stinking_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp/45px-Stinking_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Stinking_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp/60px-Stinking_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stinking Cloud\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Stinking_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp/30px-Stinking_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Stinking_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stinking_Cloud_(cloud)\" title=\"Stinking Cloud (cloud)\">Stinking Cloud</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 2 m (7 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 2 m (7 ft) Radius</p>\n<div>\n<p>Creatures caught in this cloud might be prevented from taking actions due to its foul smell.\n</p>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Cloud\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Cloud</a></dd>\n\n</dl><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Nauseous\"> Condition: Nauseous </span></h3>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nauseous_(Condition)\" title=\"Nauseous (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nauseous\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nauseous_(Condition)\" title=\"Nauseous (Condition)\">Nauseous</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"CON Save (Spell save DC)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Spell_save_DC\" title=\"Dice rolls\">Spell save DC</a>)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Can't take <a href=\"/wiki/Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Action\">Actions</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> </span>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Ghast\" title=\"Ghast\">Ghast</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Fallen_Gur_Hunter\" title=\"Fallen Gur Hunter\">Fallen Gur Hunter</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The nauseating cloud does not move with the Ghast. Instead, a new cloud will be created at the Ghast's position at the start of each of its turns.</li>\n<li>A healer wearing the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Herbalist%27s_Gloves\" title=\"Herbalist's Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Herbalist%27s_Gloves\" title=\"Herbalist's Gloves\">Herbalist's Gloves</a> can remove the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nauseous_(Condition)\" title=\"Nauseous (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nauseous\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nauseous_(Condition)\" title=\"Nauseous (Condition)\">Nauseous</a> condition from creatures they heal.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715065924\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.108 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.118 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4909/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 68827/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 23302/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.024/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1453865/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n103.79%  105.155     56 Template:Trim\n100.00%  101.320      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%  101.320      1 -total\n 25.48%   25.813     13 Template:Icon_text\n 22.15%   22.443      3 Template:Cond\n 17.52%   17.754      7 Template:Icon_link\n 15.31%   15.512      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 14.93%   15.129      1 Template:Area_full\n 13.57%   13.750      4 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 12.94%   13